# Build inputs and the working database — kept local only.
#
# The register spreadsheets under data/register/ are the exception and are
# committed with `git add -f`: they are small, and they are what a fresh clone
# needs to know which acts exist without re-scraping the whole site.
#
# data/decisions.db is deliberately NOT tracked. It is a multi-megabyte binary
# that changes every night and cannot be diffed or reviewed. The same records
# live in dataset/ as JSON — readable, greppable, reviewable in a pull request,
# and regenerated nightly. That is the off-host copy of the extraction work.
data/

# Python
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Secrets — API key for the extraction stage, kept local only
.env

# Local Claude Code config
.claude/

# Local backups of the published dataset — kept local, not served by the site
docs/*.manual-bak

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
